    },
    "source": {
      "value": "lowg"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "Exposure to the corrupting influence of the Mana Wastes' strange energies has warped your inner essence, resulting in unpredictable interactions with magic items and more than a little know-how about surviving under bizarre and adverse natural conditions.\n\nChoose two ability boosts. One must be to Constitution or Intelligence, and one is a free ability boost.\n\nYou're trained in the Arcana skill and the Wilderness Lore skill. You gain the Trick Magic Item skill feat."
    },
